{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a new world every time you play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/75b89213da3942a409aae59ca137b6bc.poster.avif?t=1770127713\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/75b89213da3942a409aae59ca137b6bc.webm?t=1770127713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/75b89213da3942a409aae59ca137b6bc.mp4?t=1770127713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Prologue: Go Wayback!</strong></i> no two journeys are ever the same.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new 64km2 world is generated on your PC every time you start the game. Our in-house machine-learning technology empowers our artists and designers to create a system that lets you generate billions of beautiful, natural worlds that are waiting to be explored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart your own course through the rugged terrain toward the distant Weather Tower. How you get there, and whether you survive, is entirely up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on an adventure to overcome the wilderness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/c52c51ff2ab460658bb7ac3ba13bbb9c.poster.avif?t=1770127713\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/c52c51ff2ab460658bb7ac3ba13bbb9c.webm?t=1770127713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/c52c51ff2ab460658bb7ac3ba13bbb9c.mp4?t=1770127713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and time of day shape your every decision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain can soak your clothes and drench your fires. Thunderstorms can wreak havoc on the terrain. Blizzards bring snow and the danger of hypothermia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage for edible food, seek sources of drinkable water, and chart your path from shelter to shelter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your choices, your world, your story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/9ab5a84456371bed87cd42b62b998341.poster.avif?t=1770127713\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/9ab5a84456371bed87cd42b62b998341.webm?t=1770127713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/9ab5a84456371bed87cd42b62b998341.mp4?t=1770127713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No guides. No markers telling you where to go next. Just your instincts, your tools, and your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to read your map, use your compass, keep an eye on the sky, and adapt to the terrain and the weather if you want to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you stick to the valleys, searching for shelter? Or climb the ridges for a clear line to the Weather Tower? Will you brave the storm at night, or hunker down and wait it out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your story is what you make it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new map every time you play</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast, procedurally generated landscapes created through the fusion of our in-house machine learning technology and human talent.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive against the elements</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your body temperature, thirst, and hunger while battling rain, wind, snow, and freezing temperatures. The weather can change\u00a0at any moment.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emergent player freedom</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers, no scripted path. How you play and what you do is up to you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic navigation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a compass, a map, and your gut feeling. With no mini map to tell you where to go, every step is a test of your awareness and orientation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Define your next run</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own map, choose a game mode, and select custom game settings to create your own unique run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The first game in our path towards Project Artemis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prologue: Go Wayback!</i> is the first of three games that lay the foundation for our studio\u2019s ultimate vision: <strong>Project Artemis</strong>. A platform for massive, living multiplayer sandboxes where millions of players can shape their own worlds and emergent stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Go Wayback!</i> represents our ongoing research into machine-learning models that can empower our developers to rapidly generate realistic, large environments in Unreal Engine 5 for players to explore. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I did it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2943740/c03ac1e4dbc9f8044d1e9d8792034cddb8efeb63.jpg"},{"name":"The first of many","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2943740/da67f71b1dd531505b5280936f6f1d8cf4c50bb7.jpg"},{"name":"DJ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2943740/2c8d6a17955320d9b42072b37a1dc7619230de92.jpg"},{"name":"So close yet so far","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2943740/ad5cc0f8313034de09a40de1dbec2e01c2a46406.jpg"},{"name":"It's a dangerous business","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2943740/189c69af2fdbb0e54489af62f6392ada5d2087ec.jpg"},{"name":"I will survive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2943740/0a9505770c6edbda5ff4420bdbb55b241b3056fd.jpg"},{"name":"The wanderer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2943740/345f8c43504dda4fd19694ae92166997b46e8aeb.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet dreams","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2943740/24fbb43198f054ae23f2f3a90de44dab8c08b913.jpg"},{"name":"The Swiss commute","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2943740/e2d7612306d09c98c2b6496ee333ac0980e1ee88.jpg"},{"name":"Tetris master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2943740/a97fc77d8d6dbd0cb198fba9c4344459d73c0267.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2943740?t=1770127713","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/77aecdfbd854d968637619391a44d533bac1dd38/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770127713","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/4e917e0a14d7da7ea168fd21bcfeb524722ea38f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770127713","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/4e917e0a14d7da7ea168fd21bcfeb524722ea38f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770127713","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3778240,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/77b22b4b0c067146211453c35867322b.avif?t=1770127713\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras_big/77b22b4b0c067146211453c35867322b.avif?t=1770127713 width=1560 height=1032 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a new world every time you play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/75b89213da3942a409aae59ca137b6bc.poster.avif?t=1770127713\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/75b89213da3942a409aae59ca137b6bc.webm?t=1770127713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/75b89213da3942a409aae59ca137b6bc.mp4?t=1770127713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Prologue: Go Wayback!</strong></i> no two journeys are ever the same.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new 64km2 world is generated on your PC every time you start the game. Our in-house machine-learning technology empowers our artists and designers to create a system that lets you generate billions of beautiful, natural worlds that are waiting to be explored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart your own course through the rugged terrain toward the distant Weather Tower. How you get there, and whether you survive, is entirely up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on an adventure to overcome the wilderness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/c52c51ff2ab460658bb7ac3ba13bbb9c.poster.avif?t=1770127713\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/c52c51ff2ab460658bb7ac3ba13bbb9c.webm?t=1770127713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/c52c51ff2ab460658bb7ac3ba13bbb9c.mp4?t=1770127713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and time of day shape your every decision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain can soak your clothes and drench your fires. Thunderstorms can wreak havoc on the terrain. Blizzards bring snow and the danger of hypothermia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage for edible food, seek sources of drinkable water, and chart your path from shelter to shelter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your choices, your world, your story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/9ab5a84456371bed87cd42b62b998341.poster.avif?t=1770127713\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/9ab5a84456371bed87cd42b62b998341.webm?t=1770127713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/extras/9ab5a84456371bed87cd42b62b998341.mp4?t=1770127713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No guides. No markers telling you where to go next. Just your instincts, your tools, and your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to read your map, use your compass, keep an eye on the sky, and adapt to the terrain and the weather if you want to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you stick to the valleys, searching for shelter? Or climb the ridges for a clear line to the Weather Tower? Will you brave the storm at night, or hunker down and wait it out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your story is what you make it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new map every time you play</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast, procedurally generated landscapes created through the fusion of our in-house machine learning technology and human talent.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive against the elements</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your body temperature, thirst, and hunger while battling rain, wind, snow, and freezing temperatures. The weather can change\u00a0at any moment.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emergent player freedom</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers, no scripted path. How you play and what you do is up to you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic navigation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a compass, a map, and your gut feeling. With no mini map to tell you where to go, every step is a test of your awareness and orientation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Define your next run</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own map, choose a game mode, and select custom game settings to create your own unique run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The first game in our path towards Project Artemis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prologue: Go Wayback!</i> is the first of three games that lay the foundation for our studio\u2019s ultimate vision: <strong>Project Artemis</strong>. A platform for massive, living multiplayer sandboxes where millions of players can shape their own worlds and emergent stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Go Wayback!</i> represents our ongoing research into machine-learning models that can empower our developers to rapidly generate realistic, large environments in Unreal Engine 5 for players to explore. </p>","developers":["PLAYERUNKNOWN Productions"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943740/082e39e6867c830fd8063fe8fb85f3f75c1536b9/header.jpg?t=1770127713","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2943740/37137428/aad7f9e304e70e602a74310852ed55f1affdeb33/1763633549/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763647169","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2943740/37137428/aad7f9e304e70e602a74310852ed55f1affdeb33/1763633549/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763647169","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2943740/37137428/aad7f9e304e70e602a74310852ed55f1affdeb33/1763633549/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763647169","id":257235125,"name":"Early Access Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257235125/